---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Wanlian Fluid Equipment"
  description="Terms of service for Quanzhou Wanlian Fluid Equipment Co., Ltd. covering quotations, samples, quality, warranty and business terms for B2B buyers."
>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 mb-20">
    <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-blue-600 uppercase">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-2 mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-12">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. General</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the website
          <a href="https://wanlian911.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">wanlian911.com</a>
          and the products and services of Quanzhou Wanlian Fluid Equipment Co., Ltd. ("Wanlian", "we", "us").
          By using this website or submitting an inquiry, you agree to these Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Information on This Website</h2>
        <p>
          Product specifications, images and descriptions on this website are provided for general
          information and pre-sales evaluation. They do not form part of any contract unless expressly
          confirmed in a written quotation or sales contract. Actual product specifications are confirmed
          in the technical datasheet and commercial offer for each order.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. Quotations and Pricing</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>All prices are quoted on an inquiry basis; no prices shown on this website constitute an offer to sell.</li>
          <li>Quotations are valid for the period stated in the quotation document and are subject to material, exchange-rate and freight changes for extended validity.</li>
          <li>Prices are typically EXW / FOB / CIF terms as agreed in the quotation. Shipping, insurance, duties and taxes are quoted separately.</li>
          <li>MOQ, lead time, packaging and payment terms are confirmed per order in writing.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Samples and Orders</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Samples may be provided subject to sample cost and shipping arrangements agreed in advance.</li>
          <li>Orders become binding only after written confirmation (PI / sales contract) by both parties.</li>
          <li>OEM/ODM and customized products are manufactured to the specifications confirmed in the sales contract; subsequent changes may affect price and lead time.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Quality and Warranty</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>Products are manufactured in accordance with the quality system and standards stated in the quotation (e.g. ISO 9001, GB, EN, ANSI, UL/FM applicable scope).</li>
          <li>Each shipment is subject to the factory's standard testing procedures (e.g. shell and seat leakage tests). Third-party inspection can be arranged at the buyer's request and cost.</li>
          <li>Warranty is provided against manufacturing defects under the terms of the sales contract, typically covering the agreed warranty period from shipment, and does not cover misuse, improper installation, or unauthorized modification.</li>
          <li>Claims must be raised in writing with supporting evidence (photos/videos, test reports) within the timeframe stated in the contract.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Certifications</h2>
        <p>
          Certifications (e.g. UL, FM, CE, LPCB, ISO 9001, GB) apply to the specific products, models and
          scopes stated in the certification documents. Buyers are responsible for confirming that the
          certification scope covers their target market and application. Certificate copies are provided
          upon request and verification.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website, including text, images, logos, product drawings and technical data,
          is the property of Wanlian or its licensors. You may not reproduce, distribute or use it for
          commercial purposes without written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, Wanlian is not liable for indirect, incidental or
          consequential damages arising from use of this website. Liability for products is governed by
          the sales contract between the parties. Nothing in these Terms limits liability that cannot be
          limited under applicable law.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. Governing Law and Disputes</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. Disputes shall first be
          resolved through friendly negotiation; failing that, they shall be submitted to the competent
          court at the place of Wanlian's registered office, unless otherwise agreed in the sales contract.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Quanzhou Wanlian Fluid Equipment Co., Ltd.<br />
          Water Heating &amp; Valves Industrial Core Zone, Quanzhou City, Fujian Province, China<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:dhuog77@gmail.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">dhuog77@gmail.com</a><br />
          Phone / WhatsApp: +86 186 8432 4501
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
